2D Array


1. Build the Prefix Sum Array
For each cell (i, j) in matrix, the prefix sum at (i, j) is the sum of all elements in the rectangle from (0, 0) to (i, j).

Formula:

prefix[i][j] = matrix[i][j]
               + prefix[i-1][j]      (if i > 0)
               + prefix[i][j-1]      (if j > 0)
               - prefix[i-1][j-1]    (if i > 0 and j > 0)


